<<wolfhuntevents>>

:: Wolf Hunters Valuables
<<location "forest">><<effects>>
<<set $wolfpackrob to 1>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"돈과 귀중품을 내놔." 당신이 말한다. "그리고 우리가 평화롭게 식사할 수 있도록 떠나."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	"Your money and valuables, darlings," you say. "Then off you go before my family gets impatient."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"돈과 귀중품을 내놔." 당신이 말한다. "내 가족의 먹이로 주기 전에."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Everything valuable. Now," you say. "Or I let them start with your legs."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Money. Jewellery. Anything useful," you say. "Drop it and walk away while I'm still being generous."
<<else>>
	"돈과 귀중품을 내놔." 당신이 말한다. "서둘러, 내가 저들을 영원히 막을 수는 없어."
<</if>>
The pack answers with a low, eager growl.
<br><br>

With shaking hands, they empty pockets and strip off rings, necklaces, and watches. The valuables clatter into a pile at their feet. The <<wolf_cave_plural>> herd them away from the fire with snapping jaws and sharp nudges, and the hunters do not look back. Only when their footsteps fade does the pack surge back toward the deer.
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 96>>
	당신은 현금 <<moneyGain 200 true true>>【와과】 함께 매우 값비싸 보이는 여러 장신구를 발견한다.
	<<blackmoney 800>><<crimeUp 800 "thievery">>
<<elseif $rng gte 51>>
	당신은 현금 <<moneyGain 50 true true>>【와과】 함께 꽤 값비싸 보이는 여러 장신구를 발견한다.
	<<blackmoney 50>><<crimeUp 50 "thievery">>
<<else>>
	당신은 현금 <<moneyGain 20 true true>>【와과】 함께 꽤 값비싸 보이는 여러 장신구를 발견한다.
	<<blackmoney 30>><<crimeUp 30 "thievery">>
<</if>>

<<endevent>>
<<npc "Black Wolf">>
검은 늑대는 <<bhimself>>【을를】 위해 사슴의 좋은 부위를 챙긴다. 당신은 사냥꾼들이 남기고 간 가방을 뒤져 당신에게 더 잘 맞는 통조림 음식을 찾는다. 당신은 사슴 옆에 앉는다.
<<stress -12>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<if $wolfpackspray isnot 1>><<set $wolfpackspray to 1>>
	<<wearProp "pepper spray">>
	당신은 그들의 물건 속에서 이상한 원통을 발견한다. 후추 스프레이 충전기처럼 보이지만, 바닥에 컴퓨터 칩이 노출되어 있다. 당신은 그것을 집어넣는다.
	<<gspraymax>><<set $spraymax += 1>><<spray 5>>
	<br><br>
	<span class="gold">후추 스프레이 충전 횟수가 추가로 1회 늘어났습니다.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
	검은 늑대가 당신 옆에 앉아 머리에 손을 얹는다. "훌륭한 사냥. 인간, 최상위 포식자. 너와 함께라면, 우린 뭐든 할 수 있다, <<ppackbrother>>."
<</if>>

무리는 한가롭게 주변을 어슬렁거리며 여유롭게 식사를 한다. 작은 다툼이 일어나자 검은 늑대는 사슴 옆에 있던 <<bhis>> 자리를 떠나 그것을 진정시킨다.
<br><br>
<<wolfpackhuntoptions>>

:: Wolf Hunters Go
<<location "forest">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"우리를 내버려 둬." 당신은 말한다. "우린 그저 평화롭게 식사하고 싶을 뿐이야."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please go," you say, glancing at the circling wolves. "I don't know how much longer I can stop this from getting worse."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	"Time to go, darlings," you say. "Run along before my family loses patience."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"꺼져." 당신은 말한다. "마음이 바뀌어서 널 내 가족의 먹이로 주기 전에."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Run," you say. "Before I let them pull you down."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Walk away," you say. "Slowly, quietly, and you'll keep all your limbs."
<<else>>
	"꺼져." 당신은 말한다. "내가 저들을 영원히 막을 수는 없어."
<</if>>
The pack growls, shoulders bunching as though ready to spring.
<br><br>

The hunters need no second warning. They back away from the camp while the <<wolf_cave_plural>> harry them from either side, teeth flashing at their heels whenever they hesitate. Once the humans are gone, the pack pours back toward the carcass in a blur of fur and hunger.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
