	<br><br>

	<<person2>>"I know," another says. <<He>> fishes a rope from a bag beside the fire and wrenches your arms behind your back before tying them together. "There. Have fun being wolf food." Their laughter follows you as <<tearful>> you stumble away from the camp, branches snagging at your skin until their voices finally fade behind you.
	<br><br>
	<<set $leftarm to "bound">><<set $rightarm to "bound">><<handheldruined>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
