:: Wolf Rival Offer
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

You begin to walk towards the rival pack. The alpha <<beasttype>> growls as you approach.
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	With your heart hammering, you lower yourself to your hands and knees and present yourself in front of the <<beastsplural>>, hoping submission will buy your pack a meal.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	Careful and deliberate, you lower yourself to your hands and knees and offer a mating posture to the <<beastsplural>>, as though making a bargain.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You obey the ugly logic of the moment, sinking to your hands and knees and baring yourself before the <<beastsplural>> without resistance.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You sink theatrically to your hands and knees, arching into a mating posture before the <<beastsplural>> as though daring them not to understand the offer.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You drop to your hands and knees with more defiance than grace, offering a mating posture to the <<beastsplural>> like a provocation.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You lower yourself slowly, making the offer feel less like surrender and more like a calculated trade: your body for your pack's meal.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You go to your hands and knees without wavering, adopting a mating posture before the <<beastsplural>> as though the bargain is yours to make.
<<else>>
	You drop to your hands and knees and adopt a mating posture in front of the <<beastsplural>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $monster is 1>>
