:: Wolf Rival Retreat
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

You measure your options and come to realise that this fight would be best avoided.
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You shrink back a step and give the rest of your <<wolf_cave_plural>> a small, urgent signal to fall back.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	You raise a steady hand and quietly signal for the rest of your <<wolf_cave_plural>> to withdraw.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	Not wanting to gamble the whole pack on pride, you lower your gaze and motion for the others to leave with you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You sweep an arm toward the trees and signal for the rest of your <<wolf_cave_plural>> to retreat with what dignity they can salvage.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You click your tongue, glare at the rival pack, and jerk your head for the others to move.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You make the retreat signal with clipped impatience, already deciding the pack will have to answer for this humiliation later.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You make a sharp, decisive gesture for the rest of your <<wolf_cave_plural>> to withdraw before the fight can spiral.
<<else>>
	You look at the rest of your <<wolf_cave_plural>> and wave at them to leave.
<</if>>
<br><br>

상대 무리의 <<beasttype>>【이가】 공격하려 다가오지만, 우두머리에게 저지당한다.
<<if $monster is 1>>
	"겁쟁이는 보내줘라." <<bhe>>【이가】 무시하듯 말한다. "싸울 가치도 없다. 손실을 줄여라."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>><<clearNPC rival_wolf>>

경쟁 무리는 사체를 끌고 가고, 당신의 <<wolf_cave_plural>> 무리는 빈손으로 떠나게 된다. 그들은 가면서 당신을 경멸적으로 쳐다본다.

